<title>POLAND: TONSIL APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>TONSIL APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.21 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.11 vs   0.12</p>
